minisign
Usage: minisign -G ... | minisign -S -s KEY -m FILE | minisign -V -p KEY -m FILE

Signs and verifies files with a single ed25519 key -- no gpg web-of-trust, just
one keypair. Prove a release is yours, or check one before you trust it. A
signature lands beside the file as `FILE.minisig`.

	-G -p pub -s sec   generate a keypair ( -W for no passphrase )
	-S -s sec -m FILE  sign FILE -> FILE.minisig
	-V -p pub -m FILE  verify FILE against its signature

See also: age, john
